    { "grep", "match-array", "json", "--json", "before-double-dash", "json", "urn:jash:query:grep:v1", "[{\"name\":\"--json\",\"type\":\"flag\",\"semantics\":\"{\\\"exclusive_group\\\":\\\"output\\\"}\"},{\"name\":\"-E\",\"type\":\"flag\",\"semantics\":\"extended POSIX matcher {\\\"aliases\\\":[\\\"--extended-regexp\\\"],\\\"repeat\\\":\\\"idempotent\\\"}\"},{\"name\":\"-G\",\"type\":\"flag\",\"semantics\":\"explicit basic default; does not reset previously selected engine {\\\"aliases\\\":[\\\"--basic-regexp\\\"],\\\"repeat\\\":\\\"idempotent\\\"}\"},{\"name\":\"-F\",\"type\":\"flag\",\"semantics\":\"literal bytes; engine precedence over P/E {\\\"aliases\\\":[\\\"--fixed-strings\\\"],\\\"repeat\\\":\\\"idempotent\\\"}\"},{\"name\":\"-P\",\"type\":\"flag\",\"semantics\":\"owned PCRE-lite translation, not full PCRE {\\\"aliases\\\":[\\\"--perl-regexp\\\"],\\\"repeat\\\":\\\"idempotent\\\"}\"},{\"name\":\"-i\",\"type\":\"flag\",\"semantics\":\"case-insensitive regex/fixed match {\\\"aliases\\\":[],\\\"repeat\\\":\\\"idempotent\\\"}\"},{\"name\":\"-w\",\"type\":\"flag\",\"semantics\":\"word boundary in regex/fixed engine {\\\"aliases\\\":[\\\"--word-regexp\\\"],\\\"repeat\\\":\\\"idempotent\\\"}\"},{\"name\":\"-x\",\"type\":\"flag\",\"semantics\":\"whole line in regex/fixed engine {\\\"aliases\\\":[\\\"--line-regexp\\\"],\\\"repeat\\\":\\\"idempotent\\\"}\"},{\"name\":\"-n\",\"type\":\"flag\",\"semantics\":\"line field is always present in structured rows {\\\"aliases\\\":[\\\"--line-number\\\"],\\\"repeat\\\":\\\"idempotent\\\"}\"},{\"name\":\"-H\",\"type\":\"flag\",\"semantics\":\"file identity is always retained in structured rows {\\\"aliases\\\":[\\\"--with-filename\\\"],\\\"repeat\\\":\\\"idempotent\\\"}\"},{\"name\":\"-h\",\"type\":\"flag\",\"semantics\":\"text prefix control; does not drop structured file identity {\\\"aliases\\\":[\\\"--no-filename\\\"],\\\"repeat\\\":\\\"idempotent\\\"}\"},{\"name\":\"-o\",\"type\":\"flag\",\"semantics\":\"one observed byte span per item {\\\"aliases\\\":[\\\"--only-matching\\\"],\\\"repeat\\\":\\\"idempotent\\\"}\"},{\"name\":\"-r\",\"type\":\"flag\",\"semantics\":\"recursive physical directory walk {\\\"aliases\\\":[],\\\"repeat\\\":\\\"idempotent\\\"}\"},{\"name\":\"-R\",\"type\":\"flag\",\"semantics\":\"same physical walk as -r; does not follow recursive symlinks {\\\"aliases\\\":[],\\\"repeat\\\":\\\"idempotent\\\"}\"},{\"name\":\"-e\",\"type\":\"string\",\"takes_value\":true,\"semantics\":\"{\\\"aliases\\\":[\\\"--regexp\\\"],\\\"repeat\\\":\\\"union; each pattern and newline alternative retains original matcher grammar\\\",\\\"maximum_occurrences\\\":64} Literal argv byte string; no NUL in argv. Equals form applies only to the long alias; attached form applies to the short option.\",\"attached_value\":true,\"equals_value\":true},{\"name\":\"-m\",\"type\":\"integer\",\"takes_value\":true,\"minimum\":0,\"maximum\":2147483647,\"semantics\":\"per-source selected-line cap; zero performs no source observation and reports incomplete {\\\"aliases\\\":[\\\"--max-count\\\"],\\\"default\\\":null,\\\"repeat\\\":\\\"last value wins\\\"} Equals form applies only to the long alias; attached form applies to the short option.\",\"attached_value\":true,\"equals_value\":true},{\"name\":\"--since\",\"type\":\"integer\",\"takes_value\":true,\"minimum\":0,\"maximum\":18446744073709551615,\"semantics\":\"resolve repository-scoped recorded chain sequence to seconds; filter recursively visited regular files by mtime >= recorded seconds; chain is parsed, not cryptographically verified {\\\"repeat\\\":\\\"last value wins\\\",\\\"requires\\\":[\\\"-r or -R\\\",\\\"at least one explicit source operand\\\"]}\",\"equals_value\":true},{\"name\":\"--include\",\"type\":\"string\",\"takes_value\":true,\"semantics\":\"recursive basename filter; include admits any matching pattern, excludes remove any matching pattern {\\\"maximum_occurrences\\\":16,\\\"maximum_bytes\\\":127,\\\"repeat\\\":\\\"union\\\"}\",\"equals_value\":true},{\"name\":\"--exclude\",\"type\":\"string\",\"takes_value\":true,\"semantics\":\"recursive basename filter; include admits any matching pattern, excludes remove any matching pattern {\\\"maximum_occurrences\\\":16,\\\"maximum_bytes\\\":127,\\\"repeat\\\":\\\"union\\\"}\",\"equals_value\":true},{\"name\":\"--exclude-dir\",\"type\":\"string\",\"takes_value\":true,\"semantics\":\"recursive basename filter; include admits any matching pattern, excludes remove any matching pattern {\\\"maximum_occurrences\\\":16,\\\"maximum_bytes\\\":127,\\\"repeat\\\":\\\"union\\\"}\",\"equals_value\":true},{\"name\":\"--\",\"type\":\"flag\"}]", "separate-document", "Historical exact-match shape retained. Line/col are one based; spans are zero-based bytes with exclusive end. No-match status1 is COMPLETE; input failures status2 retain explicit error rows. -m0 observes no input and is INCOMPLETE/match_limit. JSON retains at most4000 match bytes and discloses match_truncated; explicit JSON paging selects the semantic-query document. A semantic query is selected by any count/list/invert/quiet/context/fuzzy/smart flag, absent source operands or explicit stdin operand -, or by explicit --offset/--limit in JSON mode. Otherwise the historical exact-match shape is retained. --since uses the bounded shared chain store reader; a malformed/FIFO source fails before matches. Runtime cancel admission requires a leading selector. All locally implemented search engines and result modes; excludes full external PCRE semantics and human usage/version controls.", "urn:jash:builtin-error:v1", "none", "{\"argv\":256,\"argv_bytes\":65536,\"expanded_short_flags\":480,\"patterns\":64,\"filter_patterns_per_kind\":16,\"filter_bytes\":127,\"file_bytes\":67108864,\"total_preflight_bytes\":268435456,\"line_bytes\":65535,\"native_match_bytes\":65535,\"json_match_bytes\":4000,\"rows\":4096,\"owned_bytes\":16777216,\"depth\":64,\"visits\":100000,\"pattern_policy\":\"each -e/newline alternative compiled independently in original grammar; leftmost then longest span\",\"patterns_after_newline_split\":64,\"source_bytes\":67108864,\"total_source_bytes\":268435456,\"rows_before_summary\":4096,\"recursive_depth\":64,\"recursive_visits\":100000,\"recursive_path_bytes\":4095,\"since_chain_bytes\":16777216,\"since_chain_records\":65536,\"since_chain_line_bytes\":65536,\"since_timestamp_seconds_max\":9223372036854775807,\"since_source_policy\":\"read-only trusted store, nonblocking regular file, stable descriptor/EOF, malformed rows refused, no attestation verification\",\"argument_constraints\":[\"Options recognized before -- even after operands. Short flags can be bundled; option values remain indivisible argv tokens. Unknown or conflicting JSON/native selectors fail explicitly.\",\"A provided -e/--regexp pattern makes all positional operands sources; repeated and newline-separated patterns form a union, preserving independent BRE/ERE/fixed grammar.\",\"Matcher precedence: fuzzy, then smart, then fixed, then PCRE-lite, then ERE, then BRE. -G is accepted compatibility default and does not clear another engine flag.\",\"Heuristic fuzzy/smart engines are always case-insensitive and use their own literal rules; -i/-w/-x do not alter those engines.\",\"Result precedence: quiet > files-without-match > count > files-with-matches > spans or selected lines. Context is emitted only in line/span modes.\",\"Explicit file symlinks are followed and named identity revalidated; recursive symlink entries are skipped. Filters and --since apply to regular files encountered by recursive walk.\",\"Cooperative protocol cancellation is admitted only when the output selector is the first argument. Named FIFO operands are rejected; stdin pipe polling checks control every 50ms.\",\"No external command or human-output capture/reparse participates in these structured variants.\"],\"runtime_cancellation\":true,\"logical_credit\":null,\"presentation_budget\":\"The historical match array bypasses JASH_LLM_